                                        "entry_id": "2ace7a29-0878-3154-abf7-a72a1ebd7baa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A diagrammatic representation of a pedigree, illustrating the connections between a person's ancestors, offspring and other relatives."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f6d23ad-ca07-33d2-ad63-cf7722393996",
                                        "entry_id": "2ace7a29-0878-3154-abf7-a72a1ebd7baa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The totality of someone's ancestors and offspring."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "collective"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "030c32f7-3826-4727-aafd-cfac4143cddc",
                                                "sense_id": "6f6d23ad-ca07-33d2-ad63-cf7722393996",
                                                "text": "Heredity and environment are not the absolute arbiters of what will be, as Jesus' genealogy details in the first chapter of Matthew's Gospel. As Gardner Taylor, an African-American preacher in Brooklyn, noted, Rahab the prostitute is in the family tree of Jesus Christ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "500fda5e-ea09-4283-8db7-bf380be0e2ee",
                                                "sense_id": "6f6d23ad-ca07-33d2-ad63-cf7722393996",
                                                "text": "We're from the family tree of old school hip-hop / Kick off your shoes and relax your socks"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b2cf1a5-3386-4636-abf5-b3225b135fed",
                                                "sense_id": "6f6d23ad-ca07-33d2-ad63-cf7722393996",
                                                "text": "As the years have passed, Barack Obama's family tree has grown."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56d293a8-b60c-42aa-96a8-1f38e4ea28f4",
                                                "sense_id": "6f6d23ad-ca07-33d2-ad63-cf7722393996",
                                                "text": "It's never been discussed whether or not there is mental illness in my family tree but I know a great aunt committed suicide years before using paracetamol."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36f3e3f5-e014-41b2-96d2-3188213c822b",
                                                "sense_id": "6f6d23ad-ca07-33d2-ad63-cf7722393996",
                                                "text": "Brigitte Macron has not spoken publicly on the false gender claims since 2022, when she told French radio, RTL, the allegations were an “impossible” attack on her parents’ family tree."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce911b4f-c20d-36d7-aa31-a3fe6c9883b1",
                                        "entry_id": "2ace7a29-0878-3154-abf7-a72a1ebd7baa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A model or diagram showing the relationships and evolution of specified languages over time."
